&lt;h3&gt;Knowledge&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;K1:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; The complex political and corporate environment in which the organisation operates and own role in this&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
