&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span&gt;K3:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span&gt; The role of the environmental health service in leading on and contributing to the wider public health agenda and the health, safety and wellbeing of local communities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
